  "description": "Ho-Wen, who had retired from his long military career and was working as a daycare security guard, discovers that his former superior, Rayus, has moved into the same neighborhood. But Rayus, Ho-Wen explains, is more special than just another superior.\n\n*\"You ignored me seven times, and now you're confessing to me, do you think I'll believe you?!\"*\n\nWhat happened between a senior and junior colleague who haven't seen each other in a long time?\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)\n\n*Note: Includes 13 extra chapters.*",
